[{"headword": "נְחוּנְיָא", "parent_lexicon": "Jastrow Dictionary", "rid": "N00477", "refs": ["Mishnah Eduyot 7:9", "Megillah 28a:6", "Megillah 28a:10", "Megillah 28a:10", "Bava Kamma 50a:19", "Bava Kamma 50a:20", "Jerusalem Talmud Shekalim 5:1:12"], "content": {"senses": [{"definition": "<i>N’ḥunia</i>, "}, {"definition": " son of one Joseph ben Pakhsas (Paskas). Sifra Emor, beg. (also <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_חוּנְיָא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, חוּנְיָא 1\">חוניא</a>); Y. Naz. I, beg. 55ᵈ; a. e.", "number": "1)"}, {"definition": " name of several Tannaim. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Mishnah_Eduyot.6.2\" data-ref=\"Mishnah Eduyot 6:2\">Eduy. VI, 2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ בן אלינתן</span>.—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Mishnah_Eduyot.7.9\" data-ref=\"Mishnah Eduyot 7:9\">Ib. VII, 9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ בן גודגדא</span> (<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Mishnah_Gittin.5.5\" data-ref=\"Mishnah Gittin 5:5\">Gitt. V, 5</a> <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_יוֹחָנָן.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, יוֹחָנָן 1\">יוחנן</a>).—<a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Pirkei_Avot.3.5\" data-ref=\"Pirkei Avot 3:5\">Ab. III, 5</a>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Mishnah_Berakhot.4.2\" data-ref=\"Mishnah Berakhot 4:2\">Ber. IV, 2</a>, a. fr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ בן הקנה</span>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Megillah.28a.10\" data-ref=\"Megillah 28a:10\">Meg. 28ᵃ</a>. <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Megillah.28a.10\" data-ref=\"Megillah 28a:10\">Ib.</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ הגדול</span> (Ms. M. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastrow,_חֲנִינָא.1\" data-ref=\"Jastrow, חֲנִינָא 1\">חנינא</a>, v. Rabb. D. S. a. l. note).", "number": "—2)"}, {"definition": " <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"Jerusalem_Talmud_Shekalim.5.1.12\" data-ref=\"Jerusalem Talmud Shekalim 5:1:12\">Y. Shek. V, 48ᵈ</a>; <a class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Bava_Kamma.50a.20\" data-ref=\"Bava Kamma 50a:20\">B. Kam. 50ᵃ</a> נ׳ חופר וכ׳ N. the well-digger. Cmp. <a dir=\"rtl\" class=\"refLink\" href=\"/Jastro